# Storm, Windrider: "those creatures" are one list, each object once, fixed as the ability triggers. Bot1's Urgent Necropsy
# chooses Bot2's Memnite (an artifact creature) as its target artifact and as its target creature, and Bot2's Weaponize the
# Monsters (an enchantment, not a creature) after it: three slots, two objects. Bot2 counters the Necropsy with Mana Leak (Bot1
# declines to pay) so both targets are still there to be looked at: the Memnite has gained flying, the enchantment has not.

